<title>SRI LANKA: Hayleys up 2.7 pct on foreign buying.</title>
<headline>Hayleys up 2.7 pct on foreign buying.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hayleys Ltd rose five rupees, or 2.7 percent, to 190 rupees on foreign buying of 3,100 shares in early Tuesday trading, dealers said.  </p>
<p>&quot;Foreign buyers believe the share is cheap at current prices, because when the market peaked in early 1994 this share went to nearly 300 rupees,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>Hayleys is a holding company for one of the three biggest conglomerates listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
